SUMMARY:Nate Jackson: Big Dog Tour LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii (Early Show)
DTSTAMP:20260704T104939Z
DTSTART:20260708T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nNate Jackson is one of the fastest-rising stars in stand-up comedy\, 
	boasting over 4.5 million TikTok followers and more than 700 million globa
	l views across his viral content. Known for his electric stage presence\, 
	sharp crowd work\, and fearless approach to taboo topics\, Jackson has bee
	n selling out theaters across the U.S. on his BIG DOG TOUR. \nIn 2025\, Na
	te released his first one-hour Netflix special\, Nate Jackson: Super Funny
	\, which premiered at #3 on the Netflix Top 10. His comedy seamlessly blen
	ds masterfully crafted material with his unique style of hilarious crowd w
	ork — diving into subjects others won’t touch and leaving audiences in sti
	tches from start to finish. \nBeyond stand-up\, Nate is currently shooting
	 Season 2 of Apple TV+’s Bad Monkey and has appeared in the Lionsgate feat
	ure Good Fortune alongside Keanu Reeves\, Seth Rogen\, and Keke Palmer. He
	 has also made memorable appearances on Curb Your Enthusiasm (HBO)\, Spiri
	ted (Apple TV+)\, and Kevin Hart’s Hart of the City (Comedy Central). \nEv
	ent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nTime: 6:30 PM HST (Doors o
	pen at 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu
	\, HI 96815\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\nAge Restrictions: 18
	+ with valid ID\nFood/Beverage Minimum: $20 per person\nHosted by: Trenton
	 Cotten\, featuring Pepper Lamb\n\nAbout the Venue\nBlue Note Hawaii is Ho
	nolulu’s premier intimate live entertainment venue\, located at 2335 Kalak
	aua Avenue in the heart of Waikiki. Part of the legendary Blue Note brand\
	, this world-class venue offers a unique combination of exceptional live p
	erformances and a full-service dining experience in an intimate\, club-sty
	le setting. \nThe venue features communal-style seating that is first come
	\, first served — so arriving early is highly recommended for the best sea
	ts. A full dinner menu and full bar are available throughout the show\, wi
	th a $20 food or beverage minimum per person. The intimate atmosphere mean
	s every seat feels close to the stage\, creating an electric connection be
	tween performer and audience. \nBlue Note Hawaii has hosted some of the bi
	ggest names in comedy and music\, and its Waikiki location makes it one of
	 the most sought-after entertainment destinations in Hawaii. The venue’s w
	arm\, club-style ambiance creates an unforgettable backdrop for a night of
	 world-class stand-up comedy. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is the early show of 
	two performances on July 8 — Nate Jackson is performing two shows per nigh
	t across July 8 and 9\, giving fans multiple opportunities to catch the Bi
	g Dog Tour in Honolulu. The show features Nate headlining with host Trento
	n Cotten and special guest Pepper Lamb opening the night. \nExpect a high-
	energy\, laugh-out-loud evening of stand-up comedy featuring Nate’s signat
	ure blend of sharp material and crowd interaction. His fearless approach t
	o comedy and undeniable charisma make every show a unique\, electric exper
	ience. Arrive early to secure the best seats and enjoy dinner before the s
	how begins. \nThis is a 18+ event. Seating is communal and first come\, fi
	rst served\, so plan to arrive well before the 6:30 PM showtime to get set
	tled with food and drinks. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $50 (p
	lus fees\; resale prices may vary) \nPurchase official tickets through Tic
	ketWeb (a Ticketmaster company)\, or find resale tickets through VividSeat
	s for flexible options including pairs and premium seating. \nOfficial Tic
	ketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a com
	mission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-
	jackson-big-dog-tour-live-at-blue-note-hawaii-wednesday-early/\n\nFrom Com
	edy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-jackson-big-dog-tour-live-at-blue
	-note-hawaii-wednesday-early/
